# ==============================================================================
# VIETNAM: THE DIVIDED NATION — Environment Configuration Reference
# ==============================================================================
# No secrets or paid AI API keys are required to run this application.
# All non-sensitive runtime settings below already have safe built-in defaults
# for Google AI Studio Preview in `src/server/config.ts`, so manual entry is NOT
# required. Uncomment only when overriding in custom or production deployments.
#
# Built-in defaults in Google AI Studio Preview:
#   PORT=3000
#   APP_ENV=preview
#   SQLITE_DB_PATH=./data/vdn-preview.sqlite
#   ALLOW_PREVIEW_FIXTURE=true   (ONLY gates POST /api/matches/fixture;
#                                 NEVER disables auth/validation;
#                                 hard-locked to false in production)
#
# Optional overrides (uncomment for production / custom hosting):
# PORT=3000
# APP_ENV=production
# SQLITE_DB_PATH=/var/lib/vdn/production.sqlite
# ALLOW_PREVIEW_FIXTURE=false
